                <pb facs="0830" n="720" sameAs="frus:frus1890/pg720"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Grip to Mr. Wharton.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of Sweden and Norway</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1890-08-26"><hi rendition="#italic">August</hi> 26, 1890</date>.
                        (Received August 29.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Secretary</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge
                    the receipt of your communication of the 21st instant, inclosing me a copy of
                    the order of the day of the Secretary of the Navy of the 18th instant, relative
                    to a salute to be fired in honor of the Swedish flag on the occasion of the
                    embarkation of the remains of John Ericsson. I beg that Your Excellency will
                    have the kindness to transmit to the proper authority the expression of my
                    profound gratitude for this testimonial which the Secretary of the Navy has so
                    courteously rendered to the flag of the country which I have the honor to
                    represent here.</p>
                <p>I avail myself, also, of this occasion to express my thanks to Your Excellency
                    for having, in response to my telegram of the 22d instant, caused the order to
                    be given for the disembarking of the remains of John Ericsson at Gothenburg,
                    where the authorities have already received orders for its reception.</p>
                <p>Be pleased to accept, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">A. Grip.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
